## Running Tests

```bash
# Run all tests
pytest

# Run with coverage
pytest --cov=src/datacontact --cov-report=html

# Run specific test files
pytest tests/unit/test_rules.py
```

## Development

```bash
# Install development dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Run linting
flake8 src/ tests/

# Format code
